# Delvers S3E12 — KOA is not A-OK

**Source-identity follow-up, 2026-10-27:** The [bounded fingerprint check](../../reports/DELVERS_S3E12_SOURCE_IDENTITY_2026-10-27.md) verifies that both local finale exports match the recorded Git blobs after CRLF-to-LF conversion only, and that those blob IDs occur at the two source paths in the originally recorded local commit. Raw local bytes differ in line endings. The older opening-line-only limitation below describes the original research checkpoint; no current remote branch, full independent Qwen interpretation or audio verification is claimed. Story findings and the earlier inter-ASR metric are unchanged.

**Type:** Played **Season 3 finale / third story arc finale / FINAL EPISODE OF THE ENTIRE DELVERS CAMPAIGN** (owner-confirmed). It follows [S3E11](S3E11.md) directly and ends with both Khalazar's defeat and **a one-year playable epilogue plus final GM cinematic**. The closing out-of-game announcement explicitly calls the season/campaign over and says the show will switch back to *The Wastes* after a week off: that programming news is NOT a Delvers continuation. **Research ASR-provisional, 2026-10-26.** [Full P/Q export report](../../reports/DELVERS_S3E12_ASR_COMPARISON_2026-10-26.md).

## Post-campaign GM commentary from November-labelled bonus (out of game, NOT additional played finale)

[Later BONUS-2021-11-13 ~41–50min](../../episodes/BONUS-2021-11-13.md) explicitly identifies the unfinished ~90ft Khalazar statue as an **IRON GOLEM alternate encounter**: large sarcophagus holding Khalazar's body could have plugged into giant construct's BACK to fire beams/smash the attacking silver/minotaur army. If the party delayed for months it could have completed and surfaced. **None of these branches happened**: Koh's ACTUAL Darmah-cast Spider Climb/stealth and Evelyn's ACTUAL hose-cutting mean iron golem **NEVER ANIMATES**, destroyed when real pyramid collapses. GM also describes hypothetical Khalazar victory (enthralled Delvers, flying pyramids, possible vampire alliance)—NOT actual canon. GM confirms earlier dream victory and player agency caused him to **avoid kidnapping Penelope or wife despite unused plans**; not child race immunity. The **played S3E12 triumph and one-year epilogue remain unchanged**. [Text comparison](../../reports/BONUS_2021_11_13_ASR_COMPARISON_2026-10-26.md).

